### Corese-Server — Manual test requests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080


### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Status + statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/status


### Form 1 — GET with query parameter
GET {{baseUrl}}/sparql?query=SELECT+*+WHERE+{+?s+?p+?o+}

### Form 1 — GET with JSON content negotiation
GET {{baseUrl}}/sparql?query=SELECT+*+WHERE+{+?s+?p+?o+}
Accept: application/sparql-results+json

### Form 1 — GET with CSV content negotiation
GET {{baseUrl}}/sparql?query=SELECT+*+WHERE+{+?s+?p+?o+}
Accept: text/csv

### Form 2 — POST URL-encoded
POST {{baseUrl}}/sparql
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

query=SELECT+*+WHERE+{+?s+?p+?o+}

### Form 3 — POST direct SPARQL body
POST {{baseUrl}}/sparql
Content-Type: application/sparql-query

SELECT * WHERE { ?s ?p ?o }

### Malformed query → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/sparql?query=NOT+VALID+SPARQL


### INSERT DATA — POST direct
POST {{baseUrl}}/sparql
Content-Type: application/sparql-update

INSERT DATA {
  <http://example.org/Alice> <http://example.org/knows> <http://example.org/Bob> .
  <http://example.org/Bob>   <http://example.org/knows> <http://example.org/Carol> .
}

### Verify INSERT — SELECT should return 2 results
GET {{baseUrl}}/sparql?query=SELECT+*+WHERE+{+?s+?p+?o+}

### DELETE DATA
POST {{baseUrl}}/sparql
Content-Type: application/sparql-update

DELETE DATA {
  <http://example.org/Alice> <http://example.org/knows> <http://example.org/Bob> .
}


### PUT — create/replace a named graph
PUT {{baseUrl}}/rdf-graph-store?graph=http://example.org/graph1
Content-Type: text/turtle

@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
ex:Alice ex:knows ex:Bob .
ex:Bob   ex:knows ex:Carol .

### GET — retrieve the named graph
GET {{baseUrl}}/rdf-graph-store?graph=http://example.org/graph1
Accept: text/turtle

### GET — retrieve in RDF/XML
GET {{baseUrl}}/rdf-graph-store?graph=http://example.org/graph1
Accept: application/rdf+xml

### POST — add triples to existing graph
POST {{baseUrl}}/rdf-graph-store?graph=http://example.org/graph1
Content-Type: text/turtle

@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
ex:Dave ex:knows ex:Eve .

### GET after POST — should contain Alice + Dave
GET {{baseUrl}}/rdf-graph-store?graph=http://example.org/graph1

### PUT — replace graph (Alice should disappear)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/rdf-graph-store?graph=http://example.org/graph1
Content-Type: text/turtle

@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
ex:NewSubject ex:newPredicate ex:newObject .

### GET after PUT replace — only NewSubject
GET {{baseUrl}}/rdf-graph-store?graph=http://example.org/graph1

### DELETE — drop the named graph
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/rdf-graph-store?graph=http://example.org/graph1

### GET after DELETE → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/rdf-graph-store?graph=http://example.org/graph1

### GET non-existent graph → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/rdf-graph-store?graph=http://example.org/does-not-exist
